  "prefLabel": "Env-A 610.12 List of Sources Covered by General State Permits",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-10-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 610.12 List of Sources Covered by General State Permits.\n\n(a) The department shall maintain and update a list of sources covered by each general state permit established by the department.\n\n(b) The list shall include the following information:\n\n(1) The name of the source;\n\n(2) The location of the source;\n\n(3) The issuance date of the letter of approval for the general state permit; and\n\n(4) The number of devices covered by the general state permit(s) for each source category located at the source.\n\nSource. #6782-B, eff 6-30-98; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
